<title>SPAIN: Spain okays 3.8 pct Gas Natural sale in '96.</title>
<headline>Spain okays 3.8 pct Gas Natural sale in '96.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish state holding company SEPI said on Friday it approved the sale of the government's 3.8 percent stake in energy group Gas Natural this year.</p>
<p>SEPI said the sale would take the form of a placement with institutional investors both in Spain and abroad.</p>
<p>The offer will be subject to the approval of next Friday's cabinet meeting and as market conditions allow, SEPI said.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
